{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34398","headline":"奉和袭美所居首夏水木尤清适然有作次韵 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美所居首夏水木尤清适然有作次韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"柿阴成列药花空，却忆桐江下钓筒。\n亦以鱼虾供熟鹭，近缘樱笋识邻翁。\n闲分酒剂多还少，自记书签白间红。\n更爱夜来风月好，转思玄度对支公。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34398.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34398","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}